From a0bc68e5acb18592fdcd3d48167dad69697f9644 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:20:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 41/63] tegra_audio: driver for the Tegra 2 with the ALC5632
 codec of the AC100

Playback through I2S and DMA, the speaker through the class AB
amplifier (muted while headphones are plugged in), the S/PDIF controller
for HDMI audio, recording from the built-in or the headset microphone,
and mixer controls for the speaker, the headphones and HDMI.

/dev/audio/tegra_audio_diag serves the ac100audio tool; the self test
only runs with "self_test true" in the driver settings.

Signed-off-by: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
